flowchart TD
    A[Fresh Market Data / Timestamp] --> B{Expiry > Now?}
    B -- No --> X[EXPIRED: History Only]
    B -- Yes --> C[Active Option Universe]
    C --> D[Spot / Strike / Moneyness / T]
    D --> E[Intrinsic / Time Value / Break-even]
    E --> F[Black-Scholes / Pricing Model]
    F --> G[IV / HV]
    G --> H[Delta / Gamma / Theta / Vega / Rho]
    H --> I[OI / Volume / Bid-Ask / Spread / Liquidity]
    I --> J[ITM Probability / Leverage / Convexity / EV]
    J --> K[Macro & Economic Variables]
    K --> L[Decision History / Government / Advisors]
    L --> M[Game Theory]
    M --> N[Dynamic Systems / Feedback / Lags]
    N --> O[Codal / Fundamentals / Price Action / Technical]
    O --> P[Backtest / Calibration]
    P --> Q[Option Score + Confidence + Scenario]
    Q --> R[Rank All Active Options]
    R --> S[Decision History]
    S --> T[Knowledge Graph / Memory]

    U[Data unavailable] --> Q
    V[Anti-hindsight: immutable timestamp] --> P
